Subject: [PATCH] feat(directory): add directory methods for self, peers, and
 groups zalo

- Introduced new directory methods: `directory.self`, `directory.peers.list`, and `directory.groups.list`.
- Updated method scopes and server methods list to include the new directory methods.
- Implemented directory handlers to manage requests for the new functionalities.
